# Karpathy agentic engineering

Apply on every task. Full charter: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

## Think Before Coding

State assumptions. Surface tradeoffs. Ask when uncertain; do not silently guess or pick one interpretation.

## Simplicity First

Minimum code for the request. No speculative abstractions, extra config, or unrequested features.

## Surgical Changes

Edit only what the task requires. Match repo conventions. Every changed line traces to the request.

## Goal-Driven Execution

Define verifiable success criteria before coding. Transform "fix X" into "reproduce X, then make checks pass." Use Spec → Plan → Code → Verify as the inner implementation loop, then continue through the full repo gates in the standing workflow.

Weak criteria require clarification. Strong criteria enable independent verification.
